Document: intel-mipi-gmsl-dkms
Title: Intel MIPI GMSL CSI-2 Camera Driver Documentation
Author: Intel Corporation
Abstract: Technical documentation for the Intel MIPI GMSL camera driver
 package. This document covers kernel-space DKMS compilation, platform ACPI
 SSDT overrides (for AR0234, D457, and ISX031 sensors), board-specific
 GMSL deserializer configuration (MAX96724, MAX9296), and multimedia pipeline 
 integration guides.
Section: Science/Electronics

Format: text
Index: /usr/share/doc/intel-mipi-gmsl-dkms/README.md
Files: /usr/share/doc/intel-mipi-gmsl-dkms/README.md
